### FILE: F_62_action_model_and_loading.md
---
id: F_62
title: action model and loading
status: ready
owner: JB
affects:
policy:
  checkLinting: true
  requireTests: true
internalId: fcb9323f-abb7-4e9a-bf58-9109c63a5ed3
