- `app/src/components/card_view/card_commit_diff_panel.tsx:40` â€” changed-file selection requires a path.
- `app/src/components/card_view/card_commit_menu.tsx:26` â€” commit menu selection requires a valid index and commit.
- `app/src/components/card_view/project_card_view.tsx:145` â€” open-body menu callback requires the card element.
- `app/src/components/config/markdown_config_section.tsx:55` â€” style change requires a known preset.
