### FILE: F_061_worktree_select_on_action_popup.md
---
id: F-061
title: Select workTree from action popup
status: ready
owner: JB
affects:
policy:
  checkLinting: true
  requireTests: true
internalId: 3f683f00-ed34-40a8-afeb-9932e62b4b34
