### FILE: F-3-release-archiving-leaves-card-images-behind-breaking-relative-links.md
---
id: F-3
title: release archiving leaves card images behind, breaking relative links
status: ready
owner: JB
affects:
policy:
  checkLinting: true
  requireTests: true
internalId: 23880e2a-d82f-4373-8273-8704ae823f53
after: fb3a7428-2f7d-48dd-beda-ce7279c516e7
